  | West | Add-on | 11 |
  
  ## Sparklines
  
  Tiny inline trends share the chart engine via `<rd-chart variant="sparkline">` — stripped of axes, titles, legends. They render in tables, in prose, or inside `rd-stat`. Latency last 30 days:
  
