  Week ending **2026-05-12**. Owner: platform team. `[on track]`
  
  - **On-call:** @dana (primary), @kim (secondary)
  - **Region:** us-east-1, eu-west-1
  - **SLO target:** 99.95% monthly
  - **Last incident:** 2026-05-04 (12m, post-mortem complete)
  
  ## Health snapshot
  
  **42.6K** — Requests / day (▲ +8.2%)
  
  **184 ms** — p95 latency (▼ -12 ms)
  
  **0.31%** — Error rate (▲ +0.04 pp)
  
